  "description": "I'm a roleplayer. The kind of gamer who builds an entire character around a class and enjoys staying in character from start to finish. If you're too embarrassed to commit to the bit, you're not a real roleplayer.*\n\n\"Keep talking. I'm starting to wonder just how much of my wrath you can endure.\"*\n\nSo, as usual, when I started a newly released game, I immersed myself in my latest role: a knight with a demon sealed inside his arm... And I roleplayed to my heart's content...\n\n\"Log out.\"\n\n「Command unavailable.」\n\n\"...? Log out.\"\n\n「Command unavailable.」\n\n\"...???\"\n\nThat was the moment I realized one very important fact. I was screwed. No... I was completely fucked.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
